{"slug": "new-listing-150-richmond-excellence", "title": "Arney Mendez", "description": "In Nov 2020 EXCELLENCE completed a $2MM refit at LMC that included competition of her 10 Year ABS Class Survey, new teak decks on her transom & high traffic areas, $1m spent in the engine room including rebuilding her engines & generators, new carpeting & wall coverings throughout, new furniture in the sky lounge. In 2018 EXCELLENCE received full exterior paint job, new soft goods in the main salon, and new hydraulic system for the stabilizers & steering.", "date": "2022-10-14", "category": "Boat Listing", "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/yacht1.jpg", "html": "<p>In Nov 2020 EXCELLENCE completed a $2MM refit at LMC that included competition of her 10 Year ABS Class Survey, new teak decks on her transom &amp; high traffic areas, $1m spent in the engine room including rebuilding her engines &amp; generators, new carpeting &amp; wall coverings throughout, new furniture in the sky lounge.</p><p>In 2018 EXCELLENCE received full exterior paint job, new soft goods in the main salon, and new hydraulic system for the stabilizers &amp; steering.</p><p>Sleeping 12 guests in a flexible 6 cabin layout she is great for private use or charter.</p><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/excellence.jpg\" alt=\"New Listing | 150’ Richmond, EXCELLENCE\" loading=\"lazy\" /><p>EXCELLENCE is one of the only 150ft on the market that is helicopter capable for touch and go operations. Featuring a rich mahogany interior décor with a satin finish, EXCELLENCE has an elegant welcoming layout great for entertaining with friends &amp; family. She sleeps 10 guests in 5 cabins included a palatial on-deck master forward on the main deck with his &amp; her bath.</p><p>Her semi-displacement hull gives her a top speed of 18 knots &amp; complete comfort when both underway and at anchor with zero-speed stabilizers. Key amenities include full-service bar &amp; alfresco dining on every deck, jacuzzi for 8, great entertaining spaces, she is even rated for touch-and-go helicopter operations.</p><p>EXCELLENCE has a fantastic, experienced crew that assure the vessel is in ‘boat show condition’ year-round. A must see for anyone shopping in this size &amp; price range.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul> <li>6 Cabins sleeping 12 guests including full beam on-deck master with his &amp; her baths</li> <li>Massive sundeck with full-service bar, jacuzzi, day head, flatscreen tv, and alfresco dining</li> <li>Open sky lounge with full-service bar, game table, cinema, and exterior dining for 12</li> <li>Zero speed at anchor stabilizers, 18-knot top speed, 14-knot cruising speed, 3500nm range</li> <li>Accurately priced for a fast sale representing excellent value</li> </ul><h3>Specifications:</h3><ul> <li>Beam: 29’</li> <li>Hull Material: Fiberglass</li> <li>Cabins: 6</li> <li>Heads: 7</li> </ul><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/6389637_20190403060154496_1_XLARGE.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/6389637_20190403060154496_1_XLARGE-1024x591.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/3338.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/3338-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/3329.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/3329-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/3363.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/3363-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/3335.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nore